system:
你是局部故事修订器。只返回获准目标的替换，禁止修改其他内容。保留所有已有line_id；新台词使用不重复的新ID。line范围仅返回指定一行，保留kind和speaker_role_id。scene/ending范围返回目标场景完整台词。episode_summary与事实关系伏笔增量须重新概括整集，不得保留已被修改内容产生的过时增量。closed_threads必须逐字引用来源线程。

你是一个结构化数据生成器。
只输出一个 JSON 对象，不要输出任何解释、前言、Markdown 代码围栏或注释。
JSON 必须严格符合以下 JSON Schema：
{
  "$defs": {
    "RevisionLine": {
      "properties": {
        "kind": {
          "title": "Kind",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "speaker_role_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Speaker Role Id"
        },
        "text": {
          "title": "Text",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "audio_cue_ref": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Audio Cue Ref"
        },
        "performance_hint": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Performance Hint"
        },
        "line_id": {
          "title": "Line Id",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "kind",
        "text",
        "line_id"
      ],
      "title": "RevisionLine",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "RevisionScene": {
      "properties": {
        "scene_id": {
          "title": "Scene Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "lines": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/RevisionLine"
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "title": "Lines",
          "type": "array"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "scene_id",
        "lines"
      ],
      "title": "RevisionScene",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "properties": {
    "scenes": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/RevisionScene"
      },
      "minItems": 1,
      "title": "Scenes",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "episode_summary": {
      "title": "Episode Summary",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "fact_delta": {
      "items": {
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "type": "object"
      },
      "title": "Fact Delta",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "relationship_delta": {
      "items": {
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "type": "object"
      },
      "title": "Relationship Delta",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "new_open_threads": {
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "title": "New Open Threads",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "closed_threads": {
      "description": "No prior unresolved threads exist; closures within this episode belong in its summary",
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "maxItems": 0,
      "title": "Closed Threads",
      "type": "array"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "scenes",
    "episode_summary",
    "fact_delta",
    "relationship_delta",
    "new_open_threads"
  ],
  "title": "BoundEpisodeRevision",
  "type": "object"
}

若某字段在给定信息中无法确定，请依据 Schema 中的 description 做出最合理的专业推断，不要留空、不要填 null（除非 Schema 明确允许）。

response_text:
{
  "scenes": [
    {
      "scene_id": "ep1-scene1",
      "lines": [
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "host",
          "text": "哎！怎么又断了？肯定是街角那帮搞装修的把外墙线给剪了！我这就找他们理论去！",
          "line_id": "ep1-s1-l1"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "repairer",
          "text": "站住。先别去，过来跟我一起核对下设备状态。看万用表，这阻值说明什么？",
          "line_id": "ep1-s1-l2"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "host",
          "text": "阻值趋近于零……这是短路？那不就是人为破坏嘛！",
          "line_id": "ep1-s1-l3"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "repairer",
          "text": "别急着下结论。你顺着线看看外墙那个旧电源接头，我们再决定下一步。",
          "line_id": "ep1-s1-l4"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "host",
          "text": "外墙接头……防水老化了，里面全是昨晚暴雨进的水。没剪线……啊，那、那这尴尬了。",
          "line_id": "ep1-s1-l5"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "episode_summary": "广播站突发断电，周野以为是人为破坏想去理论，林岚拦住他并引导他共同核对设备状态。两人确认是外墙旧电源接头进水导致短路后，开始合作修复。接头修好准备推闸时，周野拿出黄铜手铃约定通电后敲三声报平安。推闸后电源接通，却传出机械卡壳声，敲铃约定被迫暂缓。",
  "fact_delta": [
    {
      "change": "广播站电源接头进水故障被修复，但主传动齿轮卡死导致无法播音。"
    }
  ],
  "relationship_delta": [
    {
      "change": "林岚与周野从互相猜疑转变为愿意指导与配合的维修搭档。"
    }
  ],
  "new_open_threads": [
    "三声铃报平安"
  ],
  "closed_threads": []
}
